                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c9d4d839-7e9b-44e4-a9aa-62298e30072b",
                        "entry_id": "4ba2fc66-1957-3964-b795-e2cc522b2e84",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "crans"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e7b9b5ba-0593-42c5-a7d9-563935aa1c85",
                        "entry_id": "4ba2fc66-1957-3964-b795-e2cc522b2e84",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "cran"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9e2073a4-65e7-3651-bd8a-bde45e0484e6",
                        "entry_id": "4ba2fc66-1957-3964-b795-e2cc522b2e84",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A measure of herrings, either imprecise or sometimes legally specified. It has oftentimes been about 37½ imperial gallons, or ~750 herrings on average (up to 1200 or even ~2500)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bddaf8a3-6958-4e5a-a24c-e1dd8bdfc1f6",
                                "sense_id": "9e2073a4-65e7-3651-bd8a-bde45e0484e6",
                                "text": "Very flattering indeed has been the success of the fishermen; and many boats have come in loaded, averaging thirty or forty crans each (every cran estimated at 1,000 herrings), and disposed of their cargoes at nine shillings per cran; but the price has been since raised to fifteen shillings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2aa2328f-2e5f-443f-8b28-1ac1161f7a15",
                                "sense_id": "9e2073a4-65e7-3651-bd8a-bde45e0484e6",
                                "text": "His brother caught three hundred cran when the seas were lavish, / Threw the bleeders back in the sea and went upon the parish."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a03dd3b-bdb0-401c-8fa2-2be9b25f7f47",
                                "sense_id": "9e2073a4-65e7-3651-bd8a-bde45e0484e6",
                                "text": "[…] And fish the knolls on the North Sea Holes\nAnd try your luck at the North Shields Gut\nWith a catch of a hundred cran."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f58c405d-ce98-447d-8116-f152683dd81f",
                                "sense_id": "9e2073a4-65e7-3651-bd8a-bde45e0484e6",
                                "text": "But I've fished a lifetime, boy and man,\nAnd the final trawl scarcely makes a cran."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec2a16db-1c49-322f-b054-16dfdfd0b35b",
                        "entry_id": "4ba2fc66-1957-3964-b795-e2cc522b2e84",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A barrel made to hold such a measure."
                        ],
